Schema-constrained output correction

- Changed the Ollama structured request format from generic "json" mode to an exact JSON Schema derived from the destination Go type.
- Generated object schemas require all declared fields and set additionalProperties=false.
- Generated array schemas constrain element types, including evidence/contradictions/assumptions as arrays of strings.
- Added explicit JSON tags for every Evaluation field and aligned the evaluator prompt to those snake_case names.
- Updated the generator prompt to place framing challenges inside an ordinary branch and prohibit extra fields.
- Preserved strict decoding; unknown fields and type mismatches are not silently accepted.
- Added a provider regression test proving the exact schema is transmitted.
- Focused tests, go test -timeout 90s ./..., go vet ./..., build, and git diff --check: PASS.

